WEBVTT

00:00:07.262 --> 00:00:08.742
Dad.

00:00:08.902 --> 00:00:11.982
Does this mean
we have to say goodbye to Dory?

00:00:13.902 --> 00:00:15.942
Yes, Nemo. We do.

00:00:17.422 --> 00:00:18.942
(DORY HUMMING)

00:00:22.502 --> 00:00:24.182
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:00:35.982 --> 00:00:37.942
MAN 1: Hey, so how much more
we got left to load?

00:00:38.102 --> 00:00:39.622
WOMAN: Uh, just this last row.

00:00:39.782 --> 00:00:42.142
MAN 2: The sooner we finish,
the sooner this truck gets to Cleveland.

00:00:42.622 --> 00:00:44.902
DORY: Watch the turn.
MARLIN: Watch what? Ow!

00:00:45.102 --> 00:00:47.902
NEMO: Too late.
DORY: Okay, I think we're close. Whee!

00:00:47.982 --> 00:00:49.462
(NEMO AND MARLIN SCREAMING)

00:00:49.702 --> 00:00:51.262
ALL: Hi!

00:00:51.382 --> 00:00:52.502
Is this quarantine?

00:00:52.582 --> 00:00:54.462
DORY: Yes! This is it!
We're in quarantine!

00:00:54.622 --> 00:00:57.062
-My parents are here!
-(ALL CHEERING)

00:00:57.142 --> 00:00:58.382
MARLIN: Where are we going?
Hey, what--

00:00:58.462 --> 00:00:59.622
No, why are we going towards the door?

00:00:59.822 --> 00:01:02.022
-We are all better!
-ALL: Yay!

00:01:02.102 --> 00:01:03.822
I feel fantastic!

00:01:04.142 --> 00:01:05.382
-(SNEEZES)
-(ALL GASP)

00:01:05.462 --> 00:01:06.422
Dude.

00:01:06.782 --> 00:01:07.782
(GASPS)

00:01:08.662 --> 00:01:11.862
My family! Come on, let's go!
Excuse me.

00:01:11.942 --> 00:01:13.102
Dory, wait a minute!

00:01:16.702 --> 00:01:20.302
I'm coming Mommy! I'm coming Daddy!

00:01:21.262 --> 00:01:24.342
Whoo-hoo! Almost home.
Almost home. I'm almost home.

00:01:24.462 --> 00:01:27.102
MARLIN: I think I'm getting
the hang of this! Oh!

00:01:30.942 --> 00:01:32.422
(WHISPERING) I hear footsteps.

00:01:33.702 --> 00:01:34.702
(ALL SCREAM)

00:01:34.822 --> 00:01:36.542
-(GASPS) Hank!
-Quiet.

00:01:36.782 --> 00:01:39.182
Hank, we need to get in that tank.
That rhymed.

00:01:39.342 --> 00:01:41.182
-Why?
-Her parents are there!

00:01:41.542 --> 00:01:42.622
Oh.

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:46.702
Look, you've got three minutes
to get everyone in this cup with you...

00:01:46.862 --> 00:01:48.702
and then I'm on that truck
to Cleveland, got it?

00:01:48.862 --> 00:01:49.742
Got it.

00:01:54.222 --> 00:01:55.502
Oh boy.

00:01:57.302 --> 00:01:58.702
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:01:59.942 --> 00:02:01.662
Mom? Dad?

00:02:01.822 --> 00:02:06.142
Mom? Dad?
Hey, everybody. It's me, Dory!

00:02:06.342 --> 00:02:07.302
(ALL GASP)

00:02:07.382 --> 00:02:09.862
Dory? Dory? Dory?
Jenny and Charlie's Dory? Dory?

00:02:09.982 --> 00:02:11.702
Mom? Dad?

00:02:12.542 --> 00:02:14.062
Mom? Dad?

00:02:15.382 --> 00:02:17.342
Mom? Dad?

00:02:18.262 --> 00:02:20.902
-She should just pick 2 and let's go.
-Dad.

00:02:21.062 --> 00:02:23.462
What? I'm kidding. It's a reunion.

00:02:23.582 --> 00:02:27.382
Mom? Dad? Where are my parents?

00:02:28.382 --> 00:02:31.462
Dory? Are you really
Jenny and Charlie's girl?

00:02:31.582 --> 00:02:34.582
Yes, I am! That's me! Where are they?

00:02:34.702 --> 00:02:37.902
Uh, well, Dory, right after
you disappeared, they thought you...

00:02:38.062 --> 00:02:41.422
Well, they thought you must have
ended up here, in quarantine.

00:02:41.502 --> 00:02:44.422
-Uh-huh?
-Come on, come on, come on.

00:02:44.542 --> 00:02:48.062
And so they came here to look for you.

00:02:48.262 --> 00:02:49.902
They're here! (GASPS) Where are they?

00:02:52.222 --> 00:02:55.742
Dory, that was years ago.

00:02:55.902 --> 00:02:58.742
-Huh?
-They never came back.

00:02:58.862 --> 00:03:00.022
Oh no.

00:03:00.142 --> 00:03:04.502
You see, Dory, when fish
don't come back from quarantine...

00:03:04.622 --> 00:03:06.862
it means they're not...

00:03:07.542 --> 00:03:08.462
What?

00:03:09.102 --> 00:03:11.302
Dory, they're gone.

00:03:11.382 --> 00:03:13.782
(GASPS) They're dead?

00:03:14.542 --> 00:03:18.102
-(ECHOING) They wanted to find you...
-Wait. Are you sure they're gone?

00:03:18.942 --> 00:03:21.062
Dory, listen, it's going to be okay.

00:03:21.222 --> 00:03:22.622
Dory, they loved you so much.

00:03:22.782 --> 00:03:25.622
Anyone not looking to go to Cleveland,
final warning!

00:03:26.142 --> 00:03:27.462
(DORY BREATHING HEAVILY)

00:03:28.342 --> 00:03:31.182
-NEMO: Dory, are you all right?
-Are you okay?

00:03:31.302 --> 00:03:34.462
-I was too late.
-MARLIN: Dory, no. No. Now listen.

00:03:34.622 --> 00:03:38.462
-I don't have a family.
-NEMO: No, Dory. That's not true.

00:03:39.142 --> 00:03:41.342
HANK: Time to go!

00:03:41.502 --> 00:03:43.342
I'm all alone.

00:03:43.502 --> 00:03:45.022
MARLIN: Dory.
NEMO: Dory!

00:03:47.262 --> 00:03:48.702
HANK: Where's everybody else?

00:03:49.622 --> 00:03:52.142
Your orange friends are on their way
to Cleveland. Ah!

00:03:52.302 --> 00:03:53.982
WOMAN: I found the octopus!
(SCREAMS)

00:03:54.102 --> 00:03:55.142
(GLASS SHATTERS)

00:03:55.262 --> 00:03:56.462
-WOMAN: Where did he go?
-(DORY PANTING)

00:03:58.302 --> 00:03:59.302
(DORY GASPS)

00:04:00.782 --> 00:04:01.782
(GRUNTS)

00:04:05.342 --> 00:04:07.462
Mommy? Daddy?

00:04:13.982 --> 00:04:14.982
Help.

00:04:16.822 --> 00:04:21.342
No. No. No. Help. Help. Help me.

00:04:21.502 --> 00:04:26.862
Help. Help me. Please.
Somebody help me!

00:04:28.182 --> 00:04:30.542
Hey, can-- Help me?
Can you help me? I've lost them!

00:04:30.702 --> 00:04:34.062
-Oh. Lost who?
-I-I-I-I...

00:04:34.222 --> 00:04:37.062
Ah, sorry, honey. I can't help you
if you don't remember.

00:04:37.702 --> 00:04:39.302
Uh... (GASPS)

00:04:40.462 --> 00:04:43.582
Oh! Can you help me? I've lost...them.

00:04:43.742 --> 00:04:45.062
Uh, can you be more specific?

00:04:45.222 --> 00:04:47.502
My-- My-- Them! Them! Them!

00:04:47.862 --> 00:04:49.702
Um... Um...

00:04:50.022 --> 00:04:51.022
(PANTING)

00:04:51.702 --> 00:04:52.702
Oh...

00:04:54.022 --> 00:04:56.382
Help! Help!

00:04:57.862 --> 00:05:00.502
Please? They're gone!

00:05:09.862 --> 00:05:11.542
(CRYING)

00:05:14.862 --> 00:05:19.702
I've lost... I've lost everyone.
(SNIFFLES) There's nothing I can do.

00:05:21.782 --> 00:05:26.062
Shoot, I can't forget.
What was I forgetting? Something.

00:05:27.422 --> 00:05:29.942
Something important. What was it? I--

00:05:31.742 --> 00:05:35.062
What was it? It's going away.

00:05:35.902 --> 00:05:39.902
It's going away. It's going because
all I can do is forget. I just forget.

00:05:40.062 --> 00:05:44.222
And I forget.
That's what I do best. That's what I do.

00:05:45.542 --> 00:05:50.102
What do I do? What do I do?
What do I do? What do I do?

00:05:50.982 --> 00:05:52.022
(GASPS)

00:05:52.102 --> 00:05:53.742
What would Dory do?

00:05:56.422 --> 00:05:58.262
I would look around.

00:06:00.782 --> 00:06:04.622
And, um, there's just water over there.
And a lot of kelp over here.

00:06:05.622 --> 00:06:07.262
Kelp is better. Okay.

00:06:09.142 --> 00:06:10.502
(PANTING)

00:06:12.982 --> 00:06:17.582
Okay. Now what? Lots of kelp.
It looks the same.

00:06:18.902 --> 00:06:23.302
It all looks the same,
except there's a rock... over there.

00:06:23.982 --> 00:06:28.942
And some sand this way.
I like sand. Sand is squishy.

00:06:32.502 --> 00:06:33.502
(PANTING)

00:06:44.662 --> 00:06:46.142
Oh this isn't going anywhere.

00:06:48.262 --> 00:06:53.382
There's nothing here.
Nothing but kelp. Lots of kelp.

00:06:53.542 --> 00:06:57.662
And some shells...this way.

00:06:58.982 --> 00:07:00.342
I like shells.

00:07:03.862 --> 00:07:07.302
I like...shells.

00:07:33.662 --> 00:07:34.982
Whoa.

